.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-setup 1  "xil-setup " 
.SH NAME
xil\-setup \- Create and verify the virtual environment a local ML worker runs under. \*(Aqchatterbox\*(Aq builds venv\-chatterbox with PyTorch (CUDA wheels when an NVIDIA GPU is found, CPU wheels otherwise) and chatterbox\-tts, then checks that it imports.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-setup\fR [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-cuda\-index\fR] [\fB\-\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-python\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create and verify the virtual environment a local ML worker runs under. \*(Aqchatterbox\*(Aq builds venv\-chatterbox with PyTorch (CUDA wheels when an NVIDIA GPU is found, CPU wheels otherwise) and chatterbox\-tts, then checks that it imports.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<DEVICE>\fR [default: auto]
PyTorch build to install (auto: CUDA if nvidia\-smi works, else CPU)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
cuda
.IP \(bu 2
cpu
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-cuda\-index\fR \fI<TAG>\fR [default: cu124]
PyTorch CUDA wheel index tag
.TP
\fB\-\-dir\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
directory to create venv\-chatterbox in
.TP
\fB\-\-python\fR \fI<VER>\fR [default: 3.13]
Python version for the venv (chatterbox\-tts needs 3.10\-3.13 for torch 2.6)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
delete and rebuild an existing venv
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
print the commands without running them
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
what to set up
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
chatterbox: Chatterbox Turbo local TTS (venv\-chatterbox)
.RE
.SH EXTRA
The venv is created in \-\-dir, else $XIL_CODEROOT, else the workspace root: the places \*(Aqxil produce\*(Aq looks for it. Uses uv when it is on PATH, otherwise python \-m venv and pip. Running it again on a working venv does nothing.
